# Tareas: protección con token. Las tres operaciones sin Authorization devuelven 401.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333/api/v1

### GET sin Authorization
# Esperado: 401 "Unauthorized access"
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

### POST sin Authorization
# Esperado: 401, no se crea nada
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "title": "x" }

### PATCH sin Authorization
# Esperado: 401, no se modifica nada
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "status": "done" }

### Sesión que se va a cerrar (inicia sesión con Grace)
# @name loginGraceTemp
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{ "email": "grace@x.com", "password": "password123" }

###
@tokenTemp = {{loginGraceTemp.response.body.data.token}}

### Cerrar esa sesión
# Esperado: 200 "Logged out successfully"
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTemp}}

### GET /tasks con el token ya cerrado
# Esperado: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTemp}}
